# Lignify: "Enchanted creature is a Treefolk with base power and toughness 0/4 and loses all abilities." Bot1 enchants Bot2's
# Ornithopter (a colorless 0/2 Thopter artifact creature with flying). "Is a Treefolk" replaces its creature types only (CR
# 205.1a): it stays an artifact creature, and colorless (unlike Kenrith's Transformation or Eaten by Piranhas). It is 0/4
# and has lost flying (CR 613.1f), so when it attacks, Bot1's Llanowar Elves, which have neither flying nor reach, block it
# (CR 702.9b). Lignify itself is a Kindred Enchantment - Treefolk Aura.

